  "historyNote": "#14341, EMERGENCY, eff 8-21-25; ss by #14503, eff 2-4-26; ss by #14503, eff 2-4-26, EXPIRES: 2-4-36 (formerly Lot 7202.21)",
  "inScheme": "https://granitestate.github.io/rules/scheme",
